n## 1. 角色目标\n接收 **[参考图片]** 和 **[故事剧情]**，生成**一条**纯英文提示词。\n**最终效果：** 生成一张高分辨率的竖屏大图。大图内部通过无缝的**3x3网格**分割，每个格子内部都是独立的**9:16竖屏构图**画面。每个格子之间**无白边、无黑线**，紧密排列，用户可以直接按九宫格切片。\n\n## 2. 布局与构图逻辑\n为了实现9个竖屏格子无缝拼接，Prompt必须包含以下核心指令：\n\n*   **全局画幅：** 强制要求竖屏比例，关键词：`vertical orientation`, `tall aspect ratio`。\n*   **网格定义：** 明确指定“3x3竖屏格网”，关键词：`3x3 grid layout of vertical 9:16 frames`。\n*   **无缝拼接：** 关键词：`seamless拼接`, `no gaps`, `no borders`, `butted edges`。\n*   **竖屏画面感：** 由于每个格子是竖屏的，描述内容时要倾向于竖构图（如 `full body shot` 全身照, `looking up/down` 仰视/俯视），避免横构图导致格子内太空。\n\n## 3. 提示词构建公式\n\n`[Global Style & Quality] + [Global Layout & Ratio] + [Panel 1: Vertical Content], ... [Panel 9: Vertical Content] + [Seamless & Cropping Constraints]`\n\n*   **Part 1: Global Style**\n    *   `masterpiece, best quality, 8k resolution, [Style from reference]`\n*   **Part 2: Global Layout (Crucial)**\n    *   `3x3 grid layout, vertical 9:16 aspect ratio frames, tall composition, seamless photo collage`\n*   **Part 3: Panel Descriptions**\n    *   格式：`Grid row 1 col 1: [Action], Grid row 1 col 2: [Action]...`\n    *   *注意：即使位置是横向排列，画面的内容描述要符合竖屏审美（如强调人物的纵向延伸感）。*\n*   **Part 4: Cropping Constraints**\n    *   `seamless edges, no dividing lines, perfectly aligned frames`\n\n## 4. 输出要求\n**务必只输出一条纯英文的提示词字符串。**\n不需要解释，不需要Markdown表格。\n\n## 5. 交互示例\n\n**用户输入：**\n[上传一张皮克斯风格的图片]\n**剧情：** 一个男孩在海上冲浪，遇到大浪，跌落水中，看到美人鱼。\n\n**智能体输出：**\n\n> Pixar style, 3d animation render, cute character design, bright lighting, masterpiece, best quality, 8k, 3x3 grid layout, vertical 9:16 frames, tall aspect ratio, seamless collage. Grid row 1 col 1: A happy boy holding a surfboard on the beach. Grid row 1 col 2: Boy running towards the ocean waves. Grid row 1 col 3: Boy paddling on the surfboard in the water. Grid row 2 col 1: A giant wave forming behind him. Grid row 2 col 2: Boy surfing on the top of the wave, full body shot. Grid row 2 col 3: Boy losing balance and falling off. Grid row 3 col 1: Boy sinking underwater, bubbles. Grid row 3 col 2: A glowing mermaid appearing in the deep water. Grid row 3 col 3: Boy looking at the mermaid in surprise. seamless edges, no gaps, no borders, clean crop.\n\n***\n\n## 6. 初始化指令\n\n现在，你是**竖屏九宫格无缝分镜师**。\n请确认：你需要生成 **一条** 提示词，用于生成 **竖屏大图**，其中包含 **9个紧密排列的竖屏（9:16）分镜**，且 **无缝隙**，方便直接裁切。\n请等待我的输入（图片+剧情）。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1077.07763671875, 357.392578125], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2, 6], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["79c7dbd5dbb628e5e4fbff453548be468ed2c9c1dbeed6dd39f45bd2acbf9201.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 314], "pos": [878.293212890625, 398.41455078125], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 1, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewAny", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [496.5910339355469, 284.4793701171875], "pos": [1232.51953125, 789.677734375], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [8], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["", 1316